{"4766060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cannon Dinghies", "steam_appid": 4766060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4766260], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sink Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of a tiny pirate dinghy and blast your friends out of the water in fast-paced naval battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4766060/extras/a1df4f74f3924d2b151350cb82b22052.avif?t=1782680674\" width=388 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire devastating broadsides, dodge incoming cannonballs, capture objectives, and use powerful abilities to turn the tide of battle. Every match is packed with close calls, lucky shots, and chaotic pirate mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're battling friends or challenging AI opponents, Cannon Dinghies is easy to jump into and designed for quick matches that fit into any gaming session.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced multiplayer naval combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King of the Hill and team-based game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique abilities and powerups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI opponents for solo play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick matches with customizable settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack and sound design</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Active Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannon Dinghies is actively being developed with new maps, game modes, abilities, cosmetics, and gameplay improvements planned throughout development. Community feedback plays a major role in shaping the future of the game.</p>"